msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Я..."

#: scenario5:scenario5_0C4432C5_4125_4ADD_B0B3_F2A8BF3982BD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3a994074233c376b01660c4d2f9c83f8a7e1c9ec5a27eacaf636475cd3ddb36a
